    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/3b185ea86e3f6b18917afc6341914452.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BLAST FROM THE PAST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/18d1030623ac84afc6761ab80a89308d.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD</strong> with an arsenal of machine cannons, Hydra rockets, Hellfire missiles, and Sidewinders. Dominate air-to-ground combat, but stay sharp\u2014enemy air forces are on the move! Engage in intense battles across land, sea, and sky as you crush enemy forces with precision and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/d07a49ebc848700b00ba0f26fdee434b.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PILOT</strong> a range of iconic attack and support helicopters, including the Cobra, Apache, Huey, Black Hawk, Scorpion, Comanche, and Chinook. Each gunship features unique flight characteristics, specialized armaments, and mission-specific roles, ensuring every aircraft brings a distinct tactical edge to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/0b45a6f5156b960bd6aac2b5f90bc6ee.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK</strong> your tactical map to track objectives and plan your assault. Engage the enemy while managing critical resources like ammo, armor, and fuel. Defend allied units, escort them to safety, and extract them from hostile territories. Gather intel from captured enemies to complete your missions and uncover hidden items across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/9cf09dee4c92e45afbe720e256aaf9d5.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/3ed12454b92e77303523aa7371d2d259.avif?t=1755252558\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIVE</strong> the golden era of gaming with heavy flashbacks to the early '90s, featuring charming 16-bit-inspired graphics and gameplay that captures the magic of the classics. Enjoy modern quality-of-life improvements that enhance the experience without losing the old-school feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/0a113efa4655685aec666ce72591c2c2.avif?t=1755252558\" width=1560 height=2210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/8b3feb801f96651b1a71088f501ce995.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/3b185ea86e3f6b18917afc6341914452.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/ef0d965d2a93e02fa9b4aaf16f49a969.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BLAST FROM THE PAST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/18d1030623ac84afc6761ab80a89308d.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/11edce79dbd5da5eb96949b9d7adb71e.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD</strong> with an arsenal of machine cannons, Hydra rockets, Hellfire missiles, and Sidewinders. Dominate air-to-ground combat, but stay sharp\u2014enemy air forces are on the move! Engage in intense battles across land, sea, and sky as you crush enemy forces with precision and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/d07a49ebc848700b00ba0f26fdee434b.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/b2d07a459ca99ff47d304c94535a96c5.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PILOT</strong> a range of iconic attack and support helicopters, including the Cobra, Apache, Huey, Black Hawk, Scorpion, Comanche, and Chinook. Each gunship features unique flight characteristics, specialized armaments, and mission-specific roles, ensuring every aircraft brings a distinct tactical edge to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/0b45a6f5156b960bd6aac2b5f90bc6ee.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.poster.avif?t=1755252558\" width=760 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.webm?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/2208a6c0baa956b138124e0c4ec85d84.mp4?t=1755252558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHECK</strong> your tactical map to track objectives and plan your assault. Engage the enemy while managing critical resources like ammo, armor, and fuel. Defend allied units, escort them to safety, and extract them from hostile territories. Gather intel from captured enemies to complete your missions and uncover hidden items across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/9cf09dee4c92e45afbe720e256aaf9d5.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/3ed12454b92e77303523aa7371d2d259.avif?t=1755252558\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIVE</strong> the golden era of gaming with heavy flashbacks to the early '90s, featuring charming 16-bit-inspired graphics and gameplay that captures the magic of the classics. Enjoy modern quality-of-life improvements that enhance the experience without losing the old-school feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/0a113efa4655685aec666ce72591c2c2.avif?t=1755252558\" width=1560 height=2210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411810/extras/8b3feb801f96651b1a71088f501ce995.avif?t=1755252558\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p>",
